    "Id": "mechdef_uberjager_UJ9-C1",
    "Name": "Uberjager UJ9-C1",
    "Details": "The -C1 was designed in response to both A and B series of the Uberjager not meeting the customer's needs. With this new line of designs, Independence Weaponry again returns to adding secondary weapons by popular request, in the form of Light PPCs and Small Pulse Lasers, in addition the the main armaments of four Superheavy Rotary AC/2. As a last touch, to enable fitting all the heavy weaponry the engine has been upgraded to an XXL.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Ballistics</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.27</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_uberjager"
  },
